{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/victoriametrics/operator","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:18:51.595Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/victoriametrics/operator/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/victoriametrics/operator"},"readme":"<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://victoriametrics.com/icons/apple-touch-icon.webp\" width=\"150\" alt=\"VictoriaMetrics logo\"/>\n</p>\n<h1 align=\"center\">VictoriaMetrics Operator</h1>\n\n[![Join our SLACK Community](https://img.shields.io/badge/Join%20our%20SLACK%20Community-621773?style=for-the-badge&logo=slack&logoColor=white)](https://inviter.co/victoriametrics/)\n[![File a Bug on GitHub](https://img.shields.io/badge/File%20a%20Bug%20on%20GitHub-E94600?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/VictoriaMetrics/issues)\n[![Source Code](https://img.shields.io/badge/Source%20Code-323232?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white)](https://github.com/VictoriaMetrics/operator/)\n</p>\n\n---\n\nWhat is operator?\n-----------------\n\nThe VictoriaMetrics Operator is a Kubernetes Operator that simplifies the deployment, scaling, and management of a full VictoriaMetrics monitoring stack on Kubernetes. It introduces Custom Resource Definitions (CRDs) like VMCluster, VMAgent, and VMAlert that let you manage complex VictoriaMetrics setups with simple declarative YAML manifests.\n\nHow to Use This Image\n---------------------\n\nThe Operator image is not typically run with docker run. Instead, it's deployed into a Kubernetes cluster, usually via Helm, where it watches for VictoriaMetrics CRDs.\n\nDeploying the Operator with Helm:\n\n```\n\n#  Add  the  VictoriaMetrics  Helm  repository\\\nhelm  repo  add  vm  https://victoriametrics.github.io/helm-charts/\\\nhelm  repo  update\n\n#  Install  the  operator\\\nhelm  install  vmoperator  vm/victoria-metrics-operator  -n  victoria-metrics  --create-namespace\n```\nAfter installation, you can create resources like a VMSingle or VMCluster in your cluster.\n\nConfiguration\n-------------\n\nThe operator itself is configured through its deployment manifest or Helm values.yaml. The VictoriaMetrics components it manages are configured through their respective CRD specs in YAML.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"victoriametrics","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/victoriametrics","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2020-07-06T18:23:42.223192Z","updated":"2026-09-03T12:21:09.78675Z","categories":["Monitoring & observability"],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":452579917,"stars":0},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":301491644733,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:2f7b70119faa099b830086ceb8cef91a4b49a49ae0565aee10d79066974fc7c4","pushed":"2024-06-28T09:45:11.595967Z","size":14702771,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/ppc64le","linux/arm64","linux/386","linux/arm/v7","unknown/unknown"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":"active"},{"name":"config-reloader-v0.75.0-rc1-fips","digest":"sha256:e919be0acd2c1408af72ba29acb049b325709559878973115ba21cdb9b0a45a0","pushed":"2026-09-03T12:19:58.608891Z","size":18587018,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/ppc64le","linux/arm64","linux/s390x"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":"active"},{"name":"config-reloader-v0.75.0-rc1","digest":"sha256:889af0e514d6a59987f6eda23d05516d97c2b83c1d2c96028a5d69512984d653","pushed":"2026-09-03T12:17:35.799407Z","size":18673663,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/ppc64le","linux/arm64","linux/s390x"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.oci.image.index.v1+json","status":"active"},{"name":"v0.75.0-rc1-fips","digest":"sha256:c87228c016257c73e1b4931fa16b747885a3503695baa80afc154818435a9588","pushed":"2026-09-03T12:15:07.324